Package: phenoloom
Type: Package
Title: CTTIR Spatial Biology Suite
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Installs and attaches the CTTIR spatial biology package suite:
    'segmantR' for cell segmentation, 'cellspecR' for validated cell tables,
    'gatekeepR' for reviewed marker gating and phenotyping, and 'phenoscapR'
    for spatial analysis and visualization. Provides a fixed suite manifest
    and an installed-version report. Analysis methods and optional external
    engines remain in their respective member packages.
